    "internal": {
      "type": "object",
      "x-visibility": "plugins",
      "description": "Plugin-only subtree (D2). Always stripped from every API v1 projection, subscription frame, and debug log, regardless of any consumer's declared capabilities. A non-owning plugin's ABI reads (STATE_UPDATE) and vosu-surface reads are instead gated by `requires`/`optional` naming field:vosu.osu.internal or a descendant of it; a whole-namespace field:vosu.osu requirement does not grant it. Disclosure control only, never confinement (docs/v2/plugin-abi.md §6.6). See docs/v2/state-schema.md's `internal` section for the full carve-out rationale.",
