              "type": ["string","null"],
              "description": "1.2.0, additive (R8): the active skin's folder (1.x `global.skin_folder`/`folders.skin`/`directPath.skinFolder`), present independent of whether a chart is selected, unlike `current`. `null` on a lazer session (content-addressed skin storage has no folder) or when 1.x's own value is the empty string it normalizes at read time."
            }
          }
        }
